      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T23:41:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e because APEX finds out all relationships from post deps mutator\n\nThe apex variants are not created before depsMutator, but the core variants are e.g. in this example\n\n```\ncc_library {\n name\u003d\"systemlib\",\n shared_libs\u003d\"apexlib\",\n)\napi_imports(\n name\u003d\"api_imports\",\n apex_libs\u003d[\"apexlib\"],\n)\n```\n\nIn the deps mutator stage for the core variant of `systemlib`, do we have sufficient information to rewrite `apexlib -\u003e apexlib.apiimport.apex`?\n\n(not blocking, I was just curious)",
